  "description": "# ⚔️ 𝕎𝔸ℝ ⚔️ #\n\n### 🔥Assault Guild🔥 ###\n\nWe fight at the top, for the top position. From no guild to a top guild within months, now causing trouble with dedication and commitment! We are living within Conquest, and Conquest lives within us!\n\nWe are looking for the strongest and most dedicated combatants to win every assault that we do. Join us in the most active guild &amp; discord for the ultimate fun experience. Apply in discord (even when we are full)\n\n### ✅ Join Requirements: ###\n* Combat level 100 | Core stats 70+ | Good gear\n* Mandatory Discord: https://discord.gg/GuRczWK6n6\n* Assault Participation \n\nThe WAR luck is real, enjoy plenty world boss drops🔥\n\n### Discord: https://discord.gg/GuRczWK6n6 ###\n🗓️ Created on: 04/Nov/2024 \nLevel 100: 10/Apr/2025\n\n# ⚔️ℍ𝔼𝔼𝔻 𝕋ℍ𝔼 ℂ𝔸𝕃𝕃 𝕆𝔽 𝕎𝔸ℝ⚔️ #",
